This file is a leftover from an agent session whose shell stopped working because the disk
quota was exhausted. It can be deleted.

What filled it: verification archives under /tmp, one per round, each carrying a full copy of
the Go build and module caches. To free the space:

    rm -rf /tmp/check* /tmp/thrum-e2e-*

If more is needed, `.gocache/` in this repository is a build cache and rebuilds itself:

    rm -rf .gocache
